      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05_old",
      "hash": "161b4bb43a176cca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_poke_02",
      "hash": "0cfbc97cbaa45b1b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_01",
      "hash": "5941293e3724d390",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來了啊！\\n那就給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳看個好東西吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_08",
      "hash": "5941323e3724e2db",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "其實呢，我終於\\n練成了[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「炫光閃」[VAR COLOR(0000)]喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_09",
      "hash": "5941313e3724e128",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "先讓我把燈關了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_02",
      "hash": "59412c3e3724d8a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了，現在這裡漆黑一片！\\n接下來要保持內心的沉靜……\\c\\n好好地來一個深呼吸……\\n這樣一來無論是多暗的地方……\\c\\n我都能……\\n感受到周圍的狀況！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_03",
      "hash": "59412b3e3724d6f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳看！就算不開燈，\\n也能感受到光明對吧！\\c\\n那是因為我的專注力\\n高到足以影響到周圍的人！\\c\\n我把這個秘術\\n也教給[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_pikachu_01",
      "hash": "701a1e6d114892aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "丘～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_eievui_01",
      "hash": "7322242f70db9f68",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_04",
      "hash": "59412e3e3724dc0f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手「什麼？要學的不是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n而是[VAR POKNAME(0002)]嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_10",
      "hash": "593dc43e3721f21a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真的假的！？牠連秘術「袈裟斬」\\n也已經學會了嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_11",
      "hash": "593dc53e3721f3cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊！\\n其實大木博士也說過，\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n似乎真的很特別呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05",
      "hash": "59412d3e3724da5c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真有趣！那我就教教看牠吧！\\n讓我再把燈關掉一次。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_06",
      "hash": "5941303e3724df75",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來吧，[VAR POKNAME(0002)]！\\n跟我一起來。\\c\\n保持內心的沉靜……\\n好好來一個深呼吸……\\c\\n用心去感受……\\n周圍的狀況！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_sys_01",
      "hash": "05efed7b7c713db0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]學會了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「炫光閃」[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_07",
      "hash": "59412f3e3724ddc2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]！\\n真是太棒了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_12",
      "hash": "593dc23e3721eeb4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要多多讓牠\\n使用秘術喔！\\c\\n秘術並不算是招式，\\n所以就算是在沒力氣戰鬥的時候\\r\\n也能使用喔！"
    }
  ],
